.cc:57] INTERNAL: RET_CHECK failure (external/org_tensorflow/tensorflow/compiler/xla/pjrt/gpu_device.cc:345) local_device->device_ordinal() == local_topology.devices_size()\r\n```\r\n\r\nAt https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/blob/master/tensorflow/compiler/xla/pjrt/gpu_device.cc#L345, the function `BuildDistributedDevices` assumes that the `device_id == local_device_count` as they get added in a for-loop.\r\n\r\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\r\n\r\njax main branch / xla master branch\r\n\r\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\r\n\r\nGPU\r\n\r\n### Additional System Info\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_at":"2022-08-18T20:10:15Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/11882/comments","created_at":"2022-08-12T16:36:19Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/11882/events","